---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="Flipnode 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-20 h-20 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/flipnode.webp`} alt="Flipnode" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">Flipnode 评测</h1>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">7.0</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30">住宅代理</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mt-1">住宅4000万+IP · 数据中心100万+IP · 195+国家 · 爬虫API</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">核心摘要</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">代理类型</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">住宅 + 数据中心 + ISP + SOCKS5</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">IP 规模</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">4000 万+ 住宅 IP / 100 万+ DC IP</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">核心特性</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">代理 + 爬虫 API · 99.99% 在线率 · 国家/城市级定位</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">额外服务</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">Web Scraper API · Google SERP API · Amazon API</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">品牌与平台概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Flipnode 是一家集代理网络和爬虫 API 于一体的数据采集服务商，提供住宅代理（4000 万+ IP，195 国家）、数据中心代理（100 万+ IP）和 ISP 代理。同时提供 Web Scraper API、Google SERP API 和 Amazon Scraper API 等数据接口。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          支持国家/城市级定位，99.99% 在线率，99.5% 成功率，24/7 客服支持。提供专属客户经理和个性化优化方案。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">产品类型</h2>
          <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30">代理 + API</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">住宅代理 · 4000万+ IP · 195+ 国家</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">DC 代理 · 100万+ IP · 美欧机房</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">Web Scraper / Google SERP / Amazon API</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">99.99% 在线率</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">城市级定位</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">24/7 客服</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">平台特性</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">代理 + API 一体化</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">除代理网络外，还提供 Web Scraper API、Google SERP API 和 Amazon Scraper API，一站式数据采集。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">大规模 IP 资源</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">4000 万+ 住宅 IP 覆盖 195 国家，100 万+ 数据中心 IP，满足各类采集任务规模需求。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">高可靠保障</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">99.99% 在线率，99.5% 成功率，实时网络性能监控，确保数据采集任务稳定运行。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">个性化服务</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">专属客户经理、24/7 全球支持、每日功能更新，提供量身定制的数据采集方案。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>代理 + 爬虫 API 一体化服务</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>4000 万+ 住宅 IP 广泛覆盖</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>99.99% 高在线率</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>专属客户经理 + 24/7 支持</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>价格信息不够透明</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>偏向企业级客户</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>自服务门槛较高</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Flipnode 是一家兼具代理网络和爬虫 API 的数据采集平台，4000 万+ 住宅 IP 和 100 万+ DC IP 的资源规模可观。代理 + API 的一体化方案让用户在同一平台完成代理管理和数据提取。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          缺点在于价格不透明，更适合企业级客户。综合评估，Flipnode 获得 7.0 分评价。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://flipnode.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 Flipnode
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
